    Bug 1879689 - Fix optional permission prompts and port other related changes. r=mkmelin


    This patch fixes the wrong (or no) permissions being shown for optional
    permission prompts. It also pulls in some upstream changes for the used
    strings.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D250234

